## Complete Website Development Prompt

# PROJECT: AFNAAN NURSES & CAREGIVER WEBSITE

Act as a senior full-stack web developer, UI/UX designer, healthcare brand strategist, and software security engineer.

Design and develop a complete, modern, premium, responsive, and fully functional website for **AFNAAN Nurses & Caregiver**, a professional nursing support, home-care, and caregiver service provider based in Lagos, Nigeria.

The website must look trustworthy, compassionate, elegant, lively, and professional. It must be suitable for families seeking qualified caregivers, elderly people needing assistance, patients requiring support at home, and individuals interested in becoming caregivers.

This must be a real, functional website, not just a static visual mockup. Build all requested pages, navigation, forms, interactions, responsive layouts, and a secure administrative dashboard.

Do not use generic placeholder text throughout the website. Write meaningful content relevant to nursing, home care, elderly care, caregiver recruitment, and healthcare support.

